/// Reflection API (`bstd.reflect` / global `Type`).
///
/// Runtime (VM) surface:
/// - `typeof(T)` → `Type`
/// - `nameof(x)` / `nameof(a.b)` → string
/// - `x is T` → inheritance-aware bool
/// - `Type.Of(value)`, `Type.GetField`, `Type.SetField`, `Type.Invoke`, `Type.IsInstance`
/// - `t.Name`, `t.Kind`, `t.Fields`, `t.Methods`
module bstd.reflect;
